<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) / Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) RA–FGF8/Wnt mutual cross-inhibition bistable determination wavefront in vertebrate somitogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 63/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Goldbeter et al.'s (2007) CYP26A1 Hill activation C(F) = V_c F^m / (K_a^m + F^m) and quasi-steady RA nullcline R*(F) = v_sc / (k_d2 + k_d1 C(F)) (L115-215), but Pass 1 requires explicit 1D reaction-diffusion PDE sharpening verification (Delta_x_front << lambda_M) and symmetric opposing VAD vs exogenous RA somite size perturbations." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py L220–L315: 1D coupled RA-FGF8/Wnt reaction-diffusion PDE solver requiring front sharpening check <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py#L220-L315>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

